      "content": "so it's basically a chain reaction. it's kinda nerve wracking because it feels like the battery is just waiting for any tiny reason to go off. is there any way to tell if a battery is about to go into that thermal runaway state before it actually happens, or is it just totally unpredictable once the swelling starts?",
